WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:06.430
PAM BONDI CERTAINLY HOPES THEY

00:00:05.729 --> 00:00:09.533
GO DEATH PENALTY.

00:00:06.564 --> 00:00:13.337
&gt;&gt;  AND NOW ONTO AN EYEWITNESS.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:17.308
A STUDENT WHO WAS AT STONEMAN

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:18.142
DOUGLAS AS THIS HORRIFIC EVENT

00:00:17.441 --> 00:00:21.078
UNFOLDED.

00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:23.948
DAVID, FIRST OF ALL, OUR

00:00:21.212 --> 00:00:26.417
THOUGHTS -- THOUGHTS AND PRAYERS

00:00:24.081 --> 00:00:29.020
SOUND AFTER A WHILE VERY TRITE

00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:31.055
AND CLICHE, BUT AS I WAS IN MY

00:00:29.153 --> 00:00:32.557
KITCHEN WATCHING THIS TODAY, AND

00:00:31.189 --> 00:00:35.860
I HAVE THREE KIDS, YOU JUST WANT

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.395
TO BREAK DOWN AND CRY.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:39.197
BUT THERE’S SO MUCH BRAVERY ON

00:00:37.528 --> 00:00:42.200
THE PART OF STUDENTS AND

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.800
TEACHERS, ACCORDING TO RECORDS,

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:45.904
ONE DIED.

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:46.271
THAT DOES GIVE US SOME HOPE IN

00:00:46.037 --> 00:00:47.772
HUMANITY.

00:00:46.404 --> 00:00:49.240
BUT TELL US WHAT HAPPENED AND

00:00:47.906 --> 00:00:52.410
WHAT YOU HEARD UNFOLD AS YOU

00:00:49.374 --> 00:00:55.480
WERE IN SCHOOL TODAY.

00:00:52.544 --> 00:00:56.948
&gt;&gt;  SO THE FIRST THING THAT I

00:00:55.613 --> 00:00:59.084
HEARD WAS ONE SINGLE GUNSHOT.

00:00:57.082 --> 00:01:03.021
WE INITIALLY THOUGHT IT WAS A

00:00:59.217 --> 00:01:04.389
DRILL BUT IT TURNED OUT TO BE

00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:06.091
ANYTHING BUT.

00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:10.495
AFTER WE HEARD THE FIRST

00:01:06.224 --> 00:01:12.898
GUNSHOT, WE HEADED DOWN THE WAY.

00:01:10.629 --> 00:01:14.533
WE STARTED HEADING TOWARDS OUR

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:16.401
DESIGNATED ZONE FOR THE FIRE.

00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:18.036
ANYWAYS, ON OUR WAY THERE, WE

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:19.638
STARTED SEEING A BUNCH OF PEOPLE

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:20.672
RUNNING AND STARTED RUNNING WITH

00:01:19.771 --> 00:01:21.039
THOSE PEOPLE IN THE OPPOSITE

00:01:20.806 --> 00:01:22.674
DIRECTION.

00:01:21.173 --> 00:01:23.976
BUT LITTLE DID WE KNOW AT THE

00:01:22.808 --> 00:01:28.514
TIME, WE WERE ACTUALLY RUNNING

00:01:24.109 --> 00:01:37.323
TOWARDS THE SCHOOL SHOOTER.

00:01:28.647 --> 00:01:40.960
BUT LUCKILY FOR THE HEROIC

00:01:37.456 --> 00:01:42.761
ACTIONS OF THE SCHOOL JANITOR,

00:01:41.093 --> 00:01:45.798
THEY SAVED OUR LIVES.

00:01:42.895 --> 00:01:46.532
AND BECAUSE OF THEIR ACTIONS,

00:01:45.931 --> 00:01:49.835
THEY SAVED --

00:01:46.665 --> 00:01:50.436
&gt;&gt;AND ARE THEY OKAY, DAVID?

00:01:49.969 --> 00:01:51.937
&gt;&gt;  YES.

00:01:50.569 --> 00:01:53.773
RIGHT NOW, AS FAR AS I KNOW,

00:01:52.071 --> 00:01:54.640
WHEN WE LEFT THEY WERE OKAY.

00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:55.541
I HAVEN’T HEARD ANYTHING

00:01:54.774 --> 00:01:57.243
OTHERWISE.

00:01:55.675 --> 00:02:00.880
BUT ALL THE STUDENTS ARE FINE.

00:01:57.376 --> 00:02:01.280
&gt;&gt;  AND, DAVID, YOU’RE A STUDENT

00:02:01.013 --> 00:02:03.950
JOURNALIST.

00:02:01.414 --> 00:02:05.418
YOU’RE WRITING IN SCHOOL, WHICH

00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:07.220
IS INCREDIBLY HELPFUL BECAUSE

00:02:05.551 --> 00:02:08.154
YOU’RE OBSERVING EVERYTHING.

00:02:07.353 --> 00:02:11.824
DID YOU KNOW THE SHOOTER?

00:02:08.287 --> 00:02:13.459
AND IF YOU DID NOT, DO YOU KNOW

00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:17.530
PEOPLE WHO KNEW HIM AND WHAT

00:02:13.593 --> 00:02:17.797
WERE THEIR OBSERVATIONS ABOUT

00:02:17.664 --> 00:02:18.398
HIM?

00:02:17.931 --> 00:02:20.800
&gt;&gt;  YES.

00:02:18.531 --> 00:02:21.601
I DID NOT KNOW THE SHOOTER

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:23.269
PERSONALLY BUT I KNOW MANY

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:24.938
PEOPLE THAT DID KNOW HIM.

00:02:23.403 --> 00:02:28.041
WHAT I’VE HEARD ABOUT HIM IS

00:02:25.071 --> 00:02:32.278
THAT HE WAS A PERSON THAT WAS

00:02:28.174 --> 00:02:33.780
VERY OFFSET, KIND OF AWKWARD.

00:02:32.412 --> 00:02:35.282
MANY PEOPLE HAVE INTERESTING

00:02:33.913 --> 00:02:37.284
STORIES ABOUT HIM THAT WERE

00:02:35.415 --> 00:02:39.819
REALLY QUITE AWKWARD FROM THEIR

00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:46.326
TIME IN MIDDLE SCHOOL AND JUST A

00:02:39.953 --> 00:02:46.593
REALLY PRECARIOUS KIND OF OFFISH

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.463
GUY.

00:02:46.726 --> 00:02:52.566
&gt;&gt;  DID YOU KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT

00:02:49.596 --> 00:02:55.469
HIS FAMILY, HIS UPBRINGING,

00:02:52.699 --> 00:02:55.769
OTHER SIBLINGS, PROBLEMS AT

00:02:55.602 --> 00:02:59.306
HOME?

00:02:55.902 --> 00:03:00.574
WAS HE IS SOCIAL PARIAH,

00:02:59.439 --> 00:03:02.009
NOBODIES TALKED TO HIM AND HE

00:03:00.707 --> 00:03:04.444
WAS REALLY ISOLATED?

00:03:02.142 --> 00:03:07.748
&gt;&gt;  AS FAR AS I KNOW, HE WAS A

00:03:04.578 --> 00:03:09.550
VERY ISOLATED PERSON SOCIALLY.

00:03:07.881 --> 00:03:10.084
HE DID NOT INTERACT WITH MANY

00:03:09.683 --> 00:03:13.520
PEOPLE.

00:03:10.217 --> 00:03:16.156
HE SEEMED TO HAVE A SOMEWHAT

00:03:13.654 --> 00:03:18.192
MESSED-UP PERSONAL LIFE AT HOME.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.261
AND THAT’S AS FAR AS I KNOW.

00:03:18.325 --> 00:03:21.095
AND I’VE HEARD THAT FROM

00:03:20.394 --> 00:03:23.597
MULTIPLE PEOPLE.

00:03:21.228 --> 00:03:27.601
&gt;&gt;  THERE WERE OTHER REPORTS

00:03:23.731 --> 00:03:33.140
THAT HE HAD THREATENED AT LEAST

00:03:27.735 --> 00:03:34.508
AND KIND OF JOKINGLY, THAT I

00:03:33.274 --> 00:03:36.978
COULD TAKE ALL OF YOU OUT.

00:03:34.642 --> 00:03:37.311
AND HE KNEW THE LAYOUT OF THE

00:03:37.111 --> 00:03:39.947
SCHOOL.

00:03:37.445 --> 00:03:41.382
HE KNEW THE EVACUATION DRILLS.

00:03:40.081 --> 00:03:42.650
HE WAS UP ON THAT THIRD FLOOR

00:03:41.516 --> 00:03:44.252
WHEN HE PULLED THE ALARM.

00:03:42.783 --> 00:03:46.287
HE KNEW THE LAYOUT.

00:03:44.385 --> 00:03:47.822
HE KNEW WHERE PEOPLE WOULD HAVE

00:03:46.421 --> 00:03:48.423
TO GO, CORRECT?

00:03:47.955 --> 00:03:50.625
&gt;&gt;  EXACTLY.

00:03:48.556 --> 00:03:53.094
AND THE AMAZING THING IS,

00:03:50.758 --> 00:03:56.197
BECAUSE OF THE HEROIC AND MORE

00:03:53.227 --> 00:03:58.466
OR LESS THE ACTIONS TAKEN BY THE

00:03:56.331 --> 00:04:00.668
BROWARD COUNTY SCHOOLS TO MAKE

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:02.337
IT A MORE SAFE SCHOOL IN THE

00:04:00.802 --> 00:04:04.739
PAST MONTHS IN RESPONSE TO THESE

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:07.475
MASS SHOOTINGS IN SCHOOLS,

00:04:04.873 --> 00:04:09.044
THEY’VE TRAINED ALL OF THE

00:04:07.609 --> 00:04:12.781
TEACHERS RECENTLY TO LOCK ALL OF

00:04:09.177 --> 00:04:15.183
THE DOORS IN CASE A HORRIFYING

00:04:12.914 --> 00:04:17.786
INCIDENT LIKE THIS HAPPENS,

00:04:15.317 --> 00:04:19.487
WE’RE AS SAFE AS WE CAN BE.

00:04:17.919 --> 00:04:21.122
AND I THINK THAT TRAINING SAVED

00:04:19.621 --> 00:04:22.424
HUNDREDS OF LIVES TODAY.

00:04:21.256 --> 00:04:24.526
&gt;&gt;  ARE THERE ANY SCHOOL

00:04:22.557 --> 00:04:26.128
OFFICIALS THE OR OTHER THAN A

00:04:24.659 --> 00:04:28.697
SECURITY GUARD WHO ARE ARMED

00:04:26.261 --> 00:04:28.964
INSIDE THE SCHOOL THAT YOU KNOW

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.033
OF?

00:04:29.097 --> 00:04:32.367
&gt;&gt;  AS FAR AS I KNOW, THERE IS A

00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:33.402
SCHOOL RESOURCE OFFICER THAT I

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:34.870
BELIEVE IS ARMED.

00:04:33.535 --> 00:04:36.805
BUT I DIDN’T HEAR MUCH ABOUT HIM

00:04:35.003 --> 00:04:37.739
OR ANYTHING THAT HE DID DURING

00:04:36.939 --> 00:04:39.107
THIS EVENT.

00:04:37.873 --> 00:04:39.741
OBVIOUSLY, I’M SURE HE WAS DOING

00:04:39.241 --> 00:04:41.643
ALL HE COULD.

00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:43.345
BUT AS FAR AS I KNOW, I HAVEN’T

00:04:41.777 --> 00:04:44.546
HEARD MUCH ABOUT HIM.

00:04:43.478 --> 00:04:45.747
BUT I’M SURE THE MEDIA KNOWS

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:50.285
MORE THAN I DO.

00:04:45.881 --> 00:04:52.688
&gt;&gt;  TELL US ABOUT THAT GAZEBO

00:04:50.419 --> 00:04:54.823
AREA WHERE CERTAIN KIDS SIT IN

00:04:52.821 --> 00:04:56.692
THE LUNCHROOM.

00:04:54.957 --> 00:04:58.727
OWENS GAZEBO OR SOMETHING LIKE

00:04:56.825 --> 00:04:59.128
THAT WHERE SOME OF THE OUTCASTS

00:04:58.861 --> 00:05:00.930
SIT.

00:04:59.261 --> 00:05:03.265
HE WASN’T EVEN WELCOME IN THAT

00:05:01.063 --> 00:05:04.633
AREA WHERE, AGAIN, IT WAS IN

00:05:03.399 --> 00:05:05.768
SOCIAL MEDIA, SOME OF THE FREAKS

00:05:04.767 --> 00:05:06.969
IN SCHOOL SIT BECAUSE THEY’RE

00:05:05.901 --> 00:05:07.303
NOT ACCEPTED IN THE REST OF THE

00:05:07.103 --> 00:05:09.739
SCHOOL.

00:05:07.436 --> 00:05:12.041
TELL ME ABOUT THAT.

00:05:09.872 --> 00:05:15.544
&gt;&gt;  YEAH.

00:05:12.174 --> 00:05:17.446
SO HE SAT IN AN AREA THAT SADLY

00:05:15.678 --> 00:05:19.215
MANY STUDENTS REFER TO AS -- I’M

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:21.884
NOT GOING TO SAY IT ON TV.

00:05:19.348 --> 00:05:23.119
BUT IT’S AN AREA WHERE VERY

00:05:22.018 --> 00:05:24.487
UNIQUE KIDS SIT AND CHILDREN

00:05:23.252 --> 00:05:25.822
THAT ARE INTERESTED IN THINGS

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:28.891
THAT ARE MORE EXTRACURRICULAR

00:05:25.955 --> 00:05:32.128
AND OUTSIDE OF SCHOOL AND HAVE

00:05:29.025 --> 00:05:34.030
AMAZING INTERESTS AND ARE JUST

00:05:32.261 --> 00:05:34.430
AS VALUABLE AS ANY STUDENT IN

00:05:34.163 --> 00:05:36.132
THIS SCHOOL.

00:05:34.564 --> 00:05:37.233
BUT THE FACT THAT HE WAS

00:05:36.266 --> 00:05:39.402
OUTCASTED BY THOSE PEOPLE, I

00:05:37.367 --> 00:05:42.238
WOULD SAY IT DOESN’T SAY A LOT.

00:05:39.535 --> 00:05:43.740
BUT ACTUALLY, IT DOES SAY A LOT

00:05:42.372 --> 00:05:45.208
BECAUSE HERE AT STONEMAN DOUGLAS

00:05:43.873 --> 00:05:46.976
HIGH SCHOOL, WE LIKE TO ACCEPT

00:05:45.341 --> 00:05:48.979
EVERYONE FOR WHO THEY ARE.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.980
WE LIKE TO BRING EVERYONE IN AND

00:05:49.112 --> 00:05:51.548
JUST EMBRACE WHO THEY ARE.

00:05:50.113 --> 00:05:53.383
AND SADLY WITH THIS PERSON, HE

00:05:51.681 --> 00:05:55.085
DIDN’T FEEL THAT WAY.

00:05:53.516 --> 00:05:55.852
HE DIDN’T FEEL ACCEPTED.

00:05:55.218 --> 00:05:57.354
AND THAT MAY HAVE BEEN PART OF

00:05:55.986 --> 00:05:59.489
THE REASON WHY HE DID THIS

00:05:57.487 --> 00:06:00.924
HORRIBLE ATROCITY THAT SHOULD

00:05:59.623 --> 00:06:04.060
NEVER HAVE HAPPENED.

00:06:01.057 --> 00:06:04.427
&gt;&gt;  ISOLATED.

00:06:04.194 --> 00:06:06.930
ISOLATED.

00:06:04.561 --> 00:06:11.001
IN ONE CASE, HE DESCRIBED

00:06:07.064 --> 00:06:13.103
HIMSELF AS BEING BULLIED.

00:06:11.134 --> 00:06:13.403
DID YOU HEAR ANYTHING ABOUT

00:06:13.236 --> 00:06:16.607
THAT?

00:06:13.537 --> 00:06:19.743
THAT HE WAS BULLIED BY ONE

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:21.578
PARTICULAR INDIVIDUAL.

00:06:19.877 --> 00:06:22.045
&gt;&gt;  I DIDN’T HEAR ANYTHING ABOUT

00:06:21.712 --> 00:06:23.480
BULLYING.

00:06:22.179 --> 00:06:25.249
HE DOES SEEM LIKE AN INDIVIDUAL

00:06:23.614 --> 00:06:29.086
WHO WOULD HAVE HAD A ROUGH TIME

00:06:25.382 --> 00:06:30.487
IN SCHOOL BASED OFF OF HIS

00:06:29.219 --> 00:06:31.388
PREVIOUS ACTIONS.

00:06:30.621 --> 00:06:33.090
INTERESTING AND WEIRD COMMENTS

00:06:31.522 --> 00:06:36.193
MADE TO PEOPLE AROUND HIM.

00:06:33.223 --> 00:06:37.595
EVEN ONE OF HIS TUTORS.

00:06:36.327 --> 00:06:40.731
&gt;&gt;  WHAT WAS THE COMMENT?

00:06:37.728 --> 00:06:44.301
WHAT WAS THAT COMMENT?

00:06:40.865 --> 00:06:46.570
&gt;&gt;  IT WAS ACTUALLY -- I DON’T

00:06:44.435 --> 00:06:48.272
WANT TO GO -- THIS PERSON TOLD

00:06:46.704 --> 00:06:50.074
ME NOT TO TELL ANYONE.

00:06:48.406 --> 00:06:50.641
&gt;&gt;  YOU DON’T HAVE TO IDENTIFY

00:06:50.207 --> 00:06:51.542
ANYBODY.

00:06:50.775 --> 00:06:54.545
BUT WHAT WAS THE COMMENT?

00:06:51.676 --> 00:06:56.314
WHAT DID HE SAY?

00:06:54.679 --> 00:06:58.950
&gt;&gt;  THE COMMENT WAS A REQUEST

00:06:56.447 --> 00:06:59.283
FOR SEXUAL RELATIONS WITH A

00:06:59.083 --> 00:07:00.051
STUDENT.

00:06:59.417 --> 00:07:01.352
&gt;&gt;  MM.

00:07:00.184 --> 00:07:03.488
&gt;&gt;  AND IT WAS VERY AWKWARD,

00:07:01.486 --> 00:07:04.722
ACCORDING TO THEM.

00:07:03.621 --> 00:07:07.058
&gt;&gt;  YEAH.

00:07:04.856 --> 00:07:08.559
AND OBVIOUSLY PROBABLY OBVIOUSLY

00:07:07.191 --> 00:07:11.496
REJECTED.

00:07:08.693 --> 00:07:13.932
DAVID, INCREDIBLY POISED

00:07:11.629 --> 00:07:15.467
DELIVERY OF INFORMATION TONIGHT.

00:07:14.065 --> 00:07:17.135
AND OUR EMOTIONS --

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.569
&gt;&gt;CAN I SAY ONE MORE THING TO

00:07:17.268 --> 00:07:19.571
THE AUDIENCE?

00:07:17.702 --> 00:07:20.672
&gt;&gt;  YES.

00:07:19.704 --> 00:07:22.474
&gt;&gt;  YEAH.

00:07:20.805 --> 00:07:23.308
I DON’T WANT THIS TO BE ANOTHER

00:07:22.607 --> 00:07:24.776
MASS SHOOTING.

00:07:23.441 --> 00:07:26.878
I DON’T WANT THIS JUST TO BE

00:07:24.909 --> 00:07:28.012
SOMETHING THAT PEOPLE FORGET.

00:07:27.011 --> 00:07:30.248
THIS IS SOMETHING THAT PEOPLE

00:07:28.146 --> 00:07:31.149
NEED TO LOOK AT AND REALIZE THAT

00:07:30.382 --> 00:07:32.884
THERE IS A SERIOUS ISSUE IN THIS

00:07:31.283 --> 00:07:33.184
COUNTRY THAT WE ALL NEED TO

00:07:33.018 --> 00:07:34.286
FACE.

00:07:33.318 --> 00:07:35.520
IT’S AN ISSUE THAT AFFECTS EACH

00:07:34.419 --> 00:07:37.556
AND EVERY ONE OF US.

00:07:35.654 --> 00:07:39.591
AND IF YOU THINK IT DOESN’T,

00:07:37.689 --> 00:07:44.329
BELIEVE ME, IT WILL, ESPECIALLY

00:07:39.724 --> 00:07:44.763
IF WE DON’T TAKE ACTION TO STEP

00:07:44.463 --> 00:07:47.132
UP.

00:07:44.896 --> 00:07:49.434
LIKE GOING TO YOUR CONGRESSMAN

00:07:47.265 --> 00:07:50.035
AND ASKING FOR HELP AND THINGS

00:07:49.568 --> 00:07:54.072
LIKE THAT.

